# One shared scale: `ν Archimedean.TruncatedTetrahedron.polyhedron`

`archimedeanTruncatedTetrahedron_nu_shared_list`: **every system of `archimedeanTruncatedTetrahedron_nu_roots_list` has its one root at the scale
`ν Archimedean.TruncatedTetrahedron.polyhedron`** (`PolynomialSystem.IsRootEq`, `Modules/System/PolyRootEq.lean`): it is the one system. `archimedeanTruncatedTetrahedron_nu_reps_list`:
the same for the same system, and `archimedeanTruncatedTetrahedron_nu_reps` the statement in Mathlib's terms alone (`IsPolyRootEq`):
`ν Archimedean.TruncatedTetrahedron.polyhedron` is the first coordinate of the root of each of these systems, each with exactly one root in its
box; it implies `IsPolyRootMax` (`IsPolyRootEq.isPolyRootMax`). There is one system (`PolynomialSystem.IsRootMax.isRootEq_singleton`).
Generated by `lean/scripts/exact_n.py` from the theorems of `Nieuwland.Certs.NieuwlandArchimedeanTruncatedTetrahedron`, `Nieuwland.Certs.NieuwlandArchimedeanTruncatedTetrahedron.Exact` and
`Nieuwland.Certs.NieuwlandArchimedeanTruncatedTetrahedron.Roots`, which it does not change.
-/

namespace Nieuwland.Polyhedra

set_option maxHeartbeats 0 in
/-- **Every system of `ν Archimedean.TruncatedTetrahedron.polyhedron` has its one root at `ν Archimedean.TruncatedTetrahedron.polyhedron`**: each of the systems of `archimedeanTruncatedTetrahedron_nu_roots_list` has exactly one root, and its scale is the Nieuwland number. -/
theorem archimedeanTruncatedTetrahedron_nu_shared_list :
    PolynomialSystem.IsRootEq [archimedeanTruncatedTetrahedron_nu_system_0] Archimedean.TruncatedTetrahedron.polyhedron.nieuwland :=
  PolynomialSystem.IsRootMax.isRootEq_singleton archimedeanTruncatedTetrahedron_nu_roots_list

/-- **The representatives of `ν Archimedean.TruncatedTetrahedron.polyhedron`**: the same system, each with exactly one root, at the scale `ν Archimedean.TruncatedTetrahedron.polyhedron`. -/
theorem archimedeanTruncatedTetrahedron_nu_reps_list :
    PolynomialSystem.IsRootEq [archimedeanTruncatedTetrahedron_nu_system_0] Archimedean.TruncatedTetrahedron.polyhedron.nieuwland :=
  archimedeanTruncatedTetrahedron_nu_shared_list

section

